o entered the classroom to test foresight, both with negative results.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wE90oMcdMHWOf6Zo9E8cCI88vyx.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 18","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"20582","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21797","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45501","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"261862","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[14]}],"link":"110071","synopsis":"In the clubroom, Yūta, Kumin, and Makoto Isshiki witness Shinka and Sanae Dekomori playing a game of Old Maid. After ten minutes, the game reaches a climax, in which the last card is torn in half due to Sanae refusing to hand it over to Shinka, thus they both lose and continue to bicker on their way home on a rainy day.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aMZD8u7hvobCc4z5blW6Rvc2rCX.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 19","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"20582","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21797","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"45501","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"261862","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[15]}],"link":"110072","synopsis":"Kuzuha Togashi deals with Yūta during his chūnibyō persona during a camping trip. While going to fetch water at a nearby stream, Yūta protects Kuzuha from chestnuts on the ground. The rest of the family later enjoys a meal of curry, but Kuzuha notices that Yūta is sitting by the campfire with a block of meat.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wLhYHEZNc3qqAqtQpH6vZZKY2EH.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 20","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"20582","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"21797","episodeNumbers":[6]},